  "title": "Triller Group Inc. Announces Share Consolidation",
  "summary": "Los Angeles, June 18, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Triller Group Inc. (Nasdaq: ILLR / ILLRW) (the “Company” or “Triller”) today announced that it will effect a share consolidation of its common stock, par value $0.001 per share (the “Common Stock”) at a ratio of 1-for-10, effective on June 23, 2026 (the “Share Consolidation”). The Company’s Common […]",
